<title>KYRGYZSTAN: TABLE-Kyrgyz Jan-Jul ind. output rises 37.8 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Kyrgyz Jan-Jul ind. output rises 37.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BISHKEK 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kyrgyzstan's industrial production totalled 9.5 billion soms in January-July 1997 and was 37.8 percent higher than a year earlier, the National Statistics Committee said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    KYRGYZSTAN INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT     Jan-July 97  Jan-July 96</p>
<p>    year-on-year pct change		 +37.8	  +10.8</p>
